{"RukuNumber":299,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":78,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنشَأَ لَكُمُ ٱلسَّمۡعَ وَٱلۡأَبۡصَٰرَ وَٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةَۚ قَلِيلٗا مَّا تَشۡكُرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَهُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نش</tajweed>َأَ لَكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمْعَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رَ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَفْــِٔدَةَ‌ۚ قَلِيل<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>اً م</tajweed>َّا تَشْكُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٨</span>","End":"٧٨","PageNumber":347,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":299,"MaqraNumber":139,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":79,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِي ذَرَأَكُمۡ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَإِلَيۡهِ تُحۡشَرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَهُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى ذَرَأَكُمْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ وَإِلَيْهِ تُحْشَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٩</span>","End":"٧٩","PageNumber":347,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":299,"MaqraNumber":139,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":80,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِي يُحۡيِۦ وَيُمِيتُ وَلَهُ ٱخۡتِلَٰفُ ٱلَّيۡلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِۚ أَفَلَا تَعۡقِلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَهُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى يُحْى<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> وَيُمِيتُ وَلَهُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>خْتِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّيْلِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><ta